  /**
   * ⚠ THIS TEST DOES NOT COVER OAuth `state` VALIDATION. It was named
   * "CSRF rejected" and asserted only `status < 500`, so it was green on a
   * platform that has never validated `state` at all — a check that could not
   * fail, and the reason the gap stayed invisible (KS-795 gate finding F-2).
